sec.p:
The formula for calculating the judgment range (for AUC, θL = 0.8, θH = 1.25; for Cmax, θL = 0.7, θH = 1.43) is as follows:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$1+\frac{\mathrm{ln}{(\theta }_{L})}{\mathrm{ln}(r)}<\beta <1+\frac{\mathrm{ln}{(\theta }_{H})}{\mathrm{ln}(r)},$$\end{document}1+ln(θL)ln(r)<β<1+ln(θH)ln(r),where H represents the highest administered dose, L represents the lowest administered dose, r = H/L, and θH and θL represent the upper and lower limits of the confidence interval, respectively.
